    "detailed_description": "<strong>Fall Of The Son</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder. Assemble powerful strategies to battle through hordes of enemies - with 4 playable characters and over 200 unique cards at your disposal. Do you have the grit and determination to make it to the end and face off against <i>The Son</i>?<br><br><i>Classes:</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Warrior</li><li>Rogue</li><li>Wizard</li><li>Monk</li></ul>Each class has a different starting deck and unique card pool offering different playstyles.<br><br><strong>Sequence</strong> your cards to optimise your damage output. Fall Of The Son features a number of <i>stats</i> and <i>status</i> effects that will influence the course of battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/941ca1f3ba8f3eee38744c8f7b356534.poster.avif?t=1753948275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/941ca1f3ba8f3eee38744c8f7b356534.webm?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/941ca1f3ba8f3eee38744c8f7b356534.mp4?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Improve</strong> after every room cleared. Choose cards to make your deck stronger, and utilise gold in shops to purchase cards and powerful <i>artifacts</i>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/483fbd72130a0eab8bf8fc20d8b436b5.poster.avif?t=1753948275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/483fbd72130a0eab8bf8fc20d8b436b5.webm?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/483fbd72130a0eab8bf8fc20d8b436b5.mp4?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Tactically</strong> play out each combat. Some battles may present <i>overwhelming</i> odds - focus your efforts to turn the tide in your favour.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/cc36610abc4c76e58ed9317891ac066c.poster.avif?t=1753948275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/cc36610abc4c76e58ed9317891ac066c.webm?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515520/extras/cc36610abc4c76e58ed9317891ac066c.mp4?t=1753948275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Roguelike:</i><br>Features a random map and enemy selection during each run. This will consist of battles, rest points, shops and random events. Your progress is lost upon death.<br><br><i>Deckbuilder:</i><br>Select a new card to add to your deck at the end of each combat. Gain access to additional cards and strategies during random events.<br><br><i>Additional modifiers:</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survival - for a truly hardcore experience</li><li>Random/upgraded deck - for a more casual/chaotic experience</li></ul>",
